  "releaseNotes": "# Breaking Changes\n\n      - ModuleField.ModuleName assignment replaced by ModuleField.SetModule(moduleName, layoutName).\n\n      # New Features\n\n      - Added the ability to set ModuleField.ModuleLayoutName via ModuleField.SetModule(moduleName, layoutName) from Script.\n\n      # Bug Fixes\n\n      - Addressed an issue that caused incorrect background color of ListLayout.\n      - Addressed an issue that caused an error when cancelling a search dialog.\n\n      # Adjustments\n\n      - Adjusted CheckBox centering style in List.",
